      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTER IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\nINDIA’S NATIONAL TREASURE AND MUSICAL LEGENT\nTHE ONE AND ONLY\nUstad Shujaat Husain Khan\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtistes\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShujaat Husain Khan\nAmit Choubey\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaturday 5th  October 2024\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t6:00 pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAuditorium de la Grande Bibliotheque\n475 Boul. de Maisonneuve E,\nMontréal, QC H2L 5C4\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthepointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
