      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTER IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\n\nSONGS OF DHARWAD\nA SOUL-STIRRING CONCERT OF HINDUSTANI CLASSICAL MUSIC\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKaivalya Kumar Gurav\nMushfiq Hashimi\nSubhen Chatterjee\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPlace:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaturday 12th April 2025\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t4:00 PM\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWalter Baker Sports Centre\n100 Malvern Dr, Nepean, ON\nK2J 4T2\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tContact +1 (613) 406-2883\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
