      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTER IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\n\nSONGS OF DHARWAD\nA SOUL-STIRRING CONCERT OF HINDUSTANI CLASSICAL MUSIC\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKaivalya Kumar Gurav\nMushfiq Hashimi\nSubhen Chatterjee\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPlace:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFriday 11th April 2025\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t6:30 PM\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tUnion Française de Montréal\n429 Avenue Viger Est\n(Metro: Champ-de-mars)\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthepointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
      }
