        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTER IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\nAN EVENING OF POETRY & REFLECTIONS\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tCurator: Ambica Sharma\nPoets and Panelist: Bhaswati Ghosh & Gurinderjit Singh\nPoets :\nAfreina Noor\nAmal Khalid\nArwa A Wahid\nLéïa St-Pierre\nDeepinder Singh Sindu\nSaurabh Saraswat\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaturday, September 28, 2024\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t6pm to 9pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLe Gesù \n1200 rue De Bleury\nMontréal, QC, H3B 3J3\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPlease donate.\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
